Feature: Payments

Owns this feature's server-side application coordination: services, feature
requests, queries, and feature-facing classes (AI_DOCS/04_Project_Structure.md
§2; 11_Backend_Architecture.md §3).

A feature must not become a separate service or an independently deployed
application. Final enforcement of authorization, Teacher Workspace isolation,
Archive behavior, and Audit Log recording stays server-side.

This placeholder keeps the directory in version control while the feature is
empty. Remove it once the feature has its first class.
